{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1368112-looking-for-old-information","id":1368112,"title":"Looking for old information","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-02-15T13:33:31-08:00","id":1368112,"title":"Looking for old information","content":"I remember in some random book between 1st and 2 nd ed, during the usurping merela was attacked and her and her warstrider vanished. Can someone point in the direction of which book that was in?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Like the Sun I am relentless even in death...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3293-rahod","name":"Rahod","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-15T18:25:29-08:00","id":1368193,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rahod</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1368112-looking-for-old-information#post1368112\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I remember in some random book between 1st and 2 nd ed, during the usurping merela was attacked and her and her warstrider vanished. Can someone point in the direction of which book that was in?</div> </div> </div> </div>I don\u2019t recall that, but <i>Kingdom of Halta</i> details a warstrider that drove itself into the forest and disappeared during the Usurpation upon the death of its Dawn Caste pilot.<br /> <br /> (Said pilot was not Marela, though, sorry, that was the closest I\u2019ve got.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-15T18:34:20-08:00","id":1368195,"title":"","content":"&quot;Between 1st and 2nd edition&quot; and mention of warstriders makes me think that it might have been Savant and Sorcerer. Do not have, though, so cannot confirm.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-15T19:17:54-08:00","id":1368200,"title":"","content":"Merela wasn't mentioned till DotFA I believe, which was late in 2E.<br /> <br /> I recall the story of her Warstrider disappearing though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-15T19:27:58-08:00","id":1368204,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1368112-looking-for-old-information?p=1368200#post1368200\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Merela wasn't mentioned till DotFA I believe, which was late in 2E.</div> </div> </div> </div>I\u2019m away from books at the moment but I\u2019m almost certain that your belief is incorrect. If nothing else, she got mentioned prior to DotFA by the writer of the Crown of Thunders in <i>Oadenol\u2019s Codex</i>, but I\u2019m also equally sure that she got name-dropped before that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-15T20:53:24-08:00","id":1368220,"title":"","content":"Either way, it was late into 2E. I know there was mention of a Solar Queen, but I didn't think we got a name till DotFA.<br /> <br /> <br /> Edit: found my copy of OC. It does not mention Merela by name. Or even says it was given to a queen or ruler of any sort. Only that the Crown of Thunders was gifted to a hero of the Primordial War. The specific of who is not given, but in later books it's made obvious.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1047,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","user":"vampire hunter D","date":". 02-15-2020, 11:56 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-15T21:26:29-08:00","id":1368221,"title":"","content":"To be pedantic:<br /> <br /> Page 10 Merela mention, Books of Sorcery 4: Roll of Glorious Divininty:, publish date: October 24, 2007<br /> Dreams of the First Age - publish date: May 14, 2008<br /> <br /> Sources: <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Books-Sorcery-Roll-Glorious-Divinity/dp/1588466981\" target=\"_blank\">Amazon 1</a>, <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Exalted-Dreams-First-John-Chambers/dp/1588466205/ref=sr_1_1?keywords=dreams+of+the+first+age&amp;qid=1581830140&amp;s=books&amp;sr=1-1\" target=\"_blank\">Amazon 2</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/10wrFXvyXnNjaFJ0XrHdIwce6rnG__0k9/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Sidereal Jumpstart</a> (3e fanwork Charmset)<br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DQXwMXm8G1IEYLl-SmuFgKGugeZxQL63/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Cascades</a> (the above in flowchart form)","edited":{"userid":1103,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1103-tikor","user":"Tikor","date":".  publish date sources 02-16-2020, 12:27 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1103-tikor","name":"Tikor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"826"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-16T14:45:26-08:00","id":1368403,"title":"","content":"Merela was originally just a name associated with the Crown of Thunders in <i>The Book of 3 Circles</i> for 1st Edition. The Crown of Thunders was mentioned again in Oadenol's Codex, but it was described as something the Unconquered Sun gifted to an unnamed Solar hero; Merela isn't named there. I'll reproduce the text of the relevant Crown of Thunders paragraph from Bo3C here:<br /> <br /> &quot;This fabulously beautiful orichalcum crown is inset with five tastefully arranged Hearthstone settings. It was forged by the servants of the Unconquered Sun as a gift to the legendary Solar Merela to commemorate her part in the victory over the Primordials. What appeared on the surface to simply be a powerful weapon was, in truth, a much more complex tool of rulership and influence.&quot; (The rest of the description is mechanics and Merela doesn't come up again.)<br /> <br /> When we were doing early design work for Dreams of the First Age and trying to figure out important historical personages that we could make into named NPCs, it was done via a giant email string that all the writers were CC:ed on. I pulled the name &quot;Merela&quot; out of that Book of 3 Circles entry and proposed her as a sort of Scarlet-Empress-but-not-really-the-Scarlet-Empress figure, someone we could position in a similar place to the Empress but then make into a completely different person to show that it's not just history repeating, and then all the writers worked out her story from there. Carl Bowen wrote his first draft of <i>Meru: A Guidebook to the Exalted City</i> very quickly, after we'd had a lot of talk about what kind of First Age we were going to write but before much of the rest of the text for the boxed set was even started and he invented the &quot;Queen M-R-L-&quot; thing for that, which rolled forward into further discussion on who Merela was how the rest of the setting sees her -- she's so respected and revered that you don't even write her full name down.<br /> <br /> Then before Dreams was published but after it was mostly written I was handed development (and writer duties for the first and third chapters) of <i>Roll of Glorious Divini(n)ty 1</i>. I put that brief mention of Merela in there on page 10, after we'd written Dreams but before it came out.<br /> <br /> I want to stress that until all that Dreams writer email brainstorming, no one had any idea that Merela was going to be a name that would ever come up again, and there was no plan for her. Her appearance in DotFA and subsequently developed biography were entirely the creation of the DotFA team, and we were not handed a timeline bible or list of biographies or other directives to go on. We made almost all of it up for the boxed set.<br /> <br /> Merela's final fate is left undefined -- she's not described as dying, or not dying, in the Usurpation. She's not described as being killed instantly in the first strike, or after a big brawl, or as having disappeared. Her death just isn't mentioned at all. I <i>personally</i> suspect that she was made a target of priority, and probably killed so fast she didn't even realize there was a betrayal going on until she was already dead, but that mostly just appeals to my sense of irony. If you want to give her a big showdown fight or have her escape and then vanish from history, with or without a giant robot, that's up to you.But I can say with some authority there's no late 1e/early 2e book that says she vanished with a warstrider.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/229-stephen-lea-sheppard","name":"Stephen Lea Sheppard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar229_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-16T18:08:34-08:00","id":1368438,"title":"","content":"<br /> Well Ink Monkeys has Merela's Sarcophagus with the Sun.<br /> <br /> My personal Headcanon is she agreed to retire to her Tomb City and officially be registered as Dead for her retirement. The Sidereal and Dragonblooded were happy with this since it was less costly then killing her and dealing with her ghost.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}